          <p><strong>Upcoming Breakfast Clubs</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>MAY, 2014:  Executive Director Networking Breakfast and Training Session</strong></li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><a href="https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:auto/h:auto/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://cftetonvalley.org/wp-content/uploads/2012/02/Leadership-at-Play-Logo.png"><img data-opt-id=379195487   decoding="async" alt="Leadership at Play Logo" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20700%20329%22%20width%3D%22700%22%20height%3D%22329%22%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22700%22%20height%3D%22329%22%20fill%3D%22%23f8f5ec%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" width="356" height="167" /><noscript><img data-opt-id=379195487  decoding="async" alt="Leadership at Play Logo" src="https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:700/h:329/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://cftetonvalley.org/wp-content/uploads/2012/02/Leadership-at-Play-Logo.png" width="356" height="167" /></noscript></a></p>
<p><strong>Topic</strong>: The Community Foundation of Teton Valley&#8217;s Breakfast Club this month is specifically geared toward local nonprofit leaders and their upper-level staff.  Don&#8217;t miss this great informational and networking opportunity! Kat Smithhammer with Leadership at Play will be on hand to present helpful information specific to leaders of nonprofit organizations.  This information is designed to be useful to both new and experienced executive directors, alike. Please be sure to bring your business cards to hand out to your colleagues!</p>
<p><strong>Date:</strong> <strong>Wednesday, May 28th, 2014 </strong></p>
<p><strong>Time: 8:30 AM &#8211; to 10:00 AM</strong></p>
<p><strong>Location: Driggs Senior Center &#8211; 60 S. Main Street, Driggs</strong></p>
<p><strong>Cost: FREE to Teton Valley nonprofit staff and board members</strong></p>
<p><strong>Registration: Contact the Community Foundation of Teton Valley at 208.354.0230 or <a href="mailto: info@cftetonvalley.org">info@cftetonvalley.org</a>. </strong></p>
